# Keep the build context small. The build needs src/, vizier/, Cargo.*,
# build.rs (none yet), assets/ (fonts + SVG marks are `include_bytes!`d), and
# not much else.
#
# Anything reached by `include_bytes!` MUST survive this file or the build
# fails at *compile* time inside the container while working fine locally —
# that is exactly what commit 6ef0902 had to fix after the tray icon moved.
# assets/ is deliberately not excluded; keep it that way.
target
**/target
.git
.github
.claude
docs
packaging/**
!packaging/icons/
!packaging/icons/icon.png
*.md
!Cargo.toml
node_modules
*.png
!packaging/icons/icon.png
*.zip
*.tar.gz
Companion Memory App.app
